<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Home | American Standard Business Solutions</title><meta name="description" content="American Standard Business Solutions (ASBS) - veteran-owned Texas supplier of office supplies, janitorial supplies and equipment, industrial paper products, chemicals, janitorial services, and facilities support services."><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"></head><body>
<header><div class="w"><a class="brand" href="index.html">American Standard <span>Business Solutions</span></a><nav><a href="index.html#services">Services</a><a href="index.html#quote">Request a Quote</a><a href="index.html#pay">Pay</a><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></nav></div></header>
<div class="hero"><div class="w"><h1>Reliable supplies, janitorial, and facility support services for government and business</h1><p>American Standard Business Solutions (ASBS) is a veteran-owned Texas company providing office, janitorial, paper, and chemical supplies, plus janitorial and facilities support services, to government agencies and private-sector organizations.</p><div class="badges"><span>Veteran-Owned</span><span>Texas CMBL Registered</span><span>Government &amp; Private Sector</span></div><p style="margin-top:22px"><a class="btn" href="#quote">Request a Quote</a> <a class="btn alt" href="tel:+12819545167">Call 281-954-5167</a></p></div></div>
<section id="services"><div class="w"><h2>What we provide</h2><div class="grid">
<div class="card"><div class="code">NAICS 424120</div><h3>Office Supplies &amp; Stationery</h3><p>Wholesale stationery and office supplies for offices, schools, and agencies.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="code">NAICS 423850</div><h3>Janitorial Supplies &amp; Equipment</h3><p>Service establishment equipment and supplies, including janitorial equipment and supplies.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="code">NAICS 424130</div><h3>Industrial Paper Products</h3><p>Paper towels, tissue, liners, packaging, and other industrial paper products.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="code">NAICS 424690</div><h3>Chemicals &amp; Cleaning Products</h3><p>Cleaning chemicals and other chemical products for facility needs.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="code">NAICS 561720</div><h3>Janitorial Services</h3><p>Commercial and facility janitorial services.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="code">NAICS 561210</div><h3>Facilities Support Services</h3><p>Custodial services plus day-to-day facility support in the Greater Houston/Katy area: grounds upkeep, minor maintenance, mail room and reception support, moving and warehouse support, and supply-room management (stocking, inventory, and replenishment).</p></div>
</div></div></section>
<section style="background:#fff"><div class="w"><h2>About ASBS</h2><p>American Standard Business Solutions was formed in Texas on July 28, 2023. The company is led by Eric LeBeaux, an Army veteran, and is registered on the Texas Comptroller's Centralized Master Bidders List (CMBL). ASBS serves both government buyers and private-sector customers with supply and service needs.</p></div></section>
<section id="quote"><div class="w"><h2>Request a quote</h2><p>Tell us what you need and we'll respond with a quote. Required fields are marked *.</p>
<div class="card"><form action="https://formsubmit.co/americanstandardsolutions@gmail.com" method="POST">
<input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New ASBS quote request"><input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table"><input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://ericlebeaux-dev.github.io/asbs-site/thanks.html"><input type="text" name="_honey" style="display:none">
<div><label>Name *<input name="name" required></label></div><div><label>Organization<input name="organization"></label></div>
<div><label>Email *<input type="email" name="email" required></label></div><div><label>Phone<input type="tel" name="phone"></label></div>
<div><label>Service needed *<select name="service" required><option value="">Select one</option><option>Office supplies / stationery</option><option>Janitorial supplies / equipment</option><option>Industrial paper products</option><option>Chemicals / cleaning products</option><option>Janitorial services</option><option>Facility support services (custodial + facility support)</option><option>Grounds upkeep / minor maintenance</option><option>Mail room / reception support</option><option>Moving / warehouse support</option><option>Supply-room management</option><option>Other</option></select></label></div>
<div><label>Quantity or scope<input name="quantity_scope"></label></div>
<div class="full"><label>Timeline<input name="timeline" placeholder="e.g. needed by Nov 15, recurring monthly"></label></div>
<div class="full"><label>Message<textarea name="message" rows="5"></textarea></label></div>
<div class="full"><button class="btn" type="submit">Submit request</button></div></form></div></div></section>
<section id="pay" style="background:#fff"><div class="w"><h2>Pay an invoice or deposit</h2><p>Secure online payment by card or bank transfer (ACH) is coming soon. All amounts are in U.S. dollars (USD). Until then, please call <a href="tel:+12819545167">281-954-5167</a> or email us to arrange payment.</p><button class="btn" disabled>Online payments coming soon</button></div></section>
<footer><div class="w"><p><strong>American Standard Business Solutions</strong> &middot; Texas · Veteran-owned · Texas CMBL registered</p><p>Phone: <a href="tel:+12819545167">281-954-5167</a> · Email: <a href="mailto:americanstandardsolutions@gmail.com">americanstandardsolutions@gmail.com</a></p><p><a href="contact.html">Contact</a> · <a href="refund.html">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</a> · <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="terms.html">Terms of Service</a> · All prices in U.S. dollars (USD).</p><p>&copy; 2026 American Standard Business Solutions. All rights reserved.</p></div></footer></body></html>
